    "summary": "Delete an entry in Recently Deleted for good, with the entries that went in with it: their bodies, checkpoints, memberships, placements, relation memberships and canvas coordinates. An entry below it that went in on its own moves up to where it lived. Refused for an entry not in Recently Deleted. Cannot be undone."
  },
  {
    "access": "write",
