          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "auto_link",
        "changed"
      ],
      "title": "SetBelowAutoLinkOut",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "summary": "Turn a level's automatic linking (「自动链接」) on or off: entries made to live in it from now on start with their own switch that way, and every entry living below it now (however deep, not those in Recently Deleted, not containers whose template does not follow its level) gets its own switch set the same, in one step one undo takes back; turned on, their names already written get linked in the background. Each entry can be changed on its own afterwards. Refused when a name would then belong to two linked entries."
  },
  {
    "access": "write",
    "book_version": 5,
