            "symmetric"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        "RowStep": {
          "description": "What one write did to one row: the pairs to put back into it (the row\nis made again, with `relation_type` and `created_at`, when it is gone)\nand the pairs to take out of it. Putting a pair back adds no other pair;\ntaking one out takes no other pair (a member goes only when all its\npairs in the row go, the row when a side is left empty).",
          "properties": {
